Description: Dimemas network simulator tool (gnu15 + mvapich2, OpenHPC)
 Dimemas is a performance analysis tool for message-passing programs. It
 enables the user to develop and tune parallel applications on a workstation,
 while providing predictions of their performance on the target machine.
 Built with the gnu15 compiler family and mvapich2 MPI stack.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
